{"kp_id": "zj-065.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-065", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "面瘫健侧合谷，地仓沿皮透向颊车，平补平泻；勿追求针尖穿出。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st4", "acupoint.st6", "acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-065.c01", "evidence_quote": "地苍透夹舌", "seg_from": 42, "seg_to": 69, "start_s": 255.35, "end_s": 400.92, "citation": {"youtube_id": "cAJNxa5sdIk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cAJNxa5sdIk&t=255s", "series": "zj", "episode": 65, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 65", "start_s": 255.35, "end_s": 400.92}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "地苍=地仓；夹舌/假车=颊车；颌骨=合谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-065.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-065", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "半身中风流涎可单取地仓；面瘫则必须地仓透颊车。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st4", "acupoint.st6"], "chapter_id": "zj-065.c01", "evidence_quote": "地仓能够拖到假车", "seg_from": 58, "seg_to": 59, "start_s": 334.94, "end_s": 345.055, "citation": {"youtube_id": "cAJNxa5sdIk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cAJNxa5sdIk&t=334s", "series": "zj", "episode": 65, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 65", "start_s": 334.94, "end_s": 345.06}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-065.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-065", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "部分皮肤疹不必梅花针，热水浴令汗出即可；汗出受风可致面瘫，须防再发。", "entity_ids": ["syndrome.zhong_feng"], "chapter_id": "zj-065.c01", "evidence_quote": "梅花针给，他打不需要", "seg_from": 90, "seg_to": 124, "start_s": 505.5, "end_s": 711.475, "citation": {"youtube_id": "cAJNxa5sdIk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cAJNxa5sdIk&t=505s", "series": "zj", "episode": 65, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 65", "start_s": 505.5, "end_s": 711.48}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-065.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-065", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "舌强不语于金津、玉液三棱点刺放血；不宜留针或灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ex_jin_jin", "acupoint.ex_yu_ye"], "chapter_id": "zj-065.c02", "evidence_quote": "金津和玉液", "seg_from": 142, "seg_to": 146, "start_s": 799.39, "end_s": 830.29, "citation": {"youtube_id": "cAJNxa5sdIk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cAJNxa5sdIk&t=799s", "series": "zj", "episode": 65, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 65", "start_s": 799.39, "end_s": 830.29}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-065.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-065", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "咽痛可取列缺、照海，针入常可迅速止痛。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lu7", "acupoint.ki6"], "chapter_id": "zj-065.c02", "evidence_quote": "喉咙就不痛了", "seg_from": 205, "seg_to": 205, "start_s": 1147.667, "end_s": 1158.697, "citation": {"youtube_id": "cAJNxa5sdIk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cAJNxa5sdIk&t=1147s", "series": "zj", "episode": 65, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 65", "start_s": 1147.67, "end_s": 1158.7}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "裂缺=列缺；造海=照海", "source": "llm_read"}
